    "title": "Men's basketball assistant coach promoted to head coach position - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Adam Komo ,\n1 days ago Point Park hired a new men’s basketball head coach, Joe Long, on Thursday. The head coaching job opened up after former head coach Ryan Grandits resigned to accept a head coaching position at his former institution, Daemen University. Long joined the Pioneers as an assistant coach for the 2024-25... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
